Based on xblock-kinescope by OpenCraft
(https://github.com/open-craft/xblock-kinescope), which embeds content from
Kinescope (https://kinescope.io).

Robbo modifications add Studio caption controls (optional text above the
video), Russian UI strings, and make Open edX course export/import (OLX)
persist ``video_link``, ``header_text``, and related fields on the kinescope
tag.

See LICENSE in this repository. Corresponding source for deployed services:
https://skill.robbo.ru (and sibling Robbo Open edX instances).
